cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the associated article."
title: "bpmn2dmn: extraction of DMN decision requirements diagrams from BPMN process models"
type: software
abstract: "Extracts a DMN decision requirements diagram from a BPMN 2.0 process model by a formal graph transformation (six patterns) with hybrid filtering of decision candidates, checks eight invariants on the result and records every question left to the human expert."
